  "conclusion": "v1.5 beats untrained LaBSE under both scorings and the effect is larger under the ratio margin the method specifies: error rate 0.2932 against 0.3343, McNemar exact p = 0.000833 on 93 wins to 52, and a paired bootstrap of -0.0412 with a 95% interval of [-0.0653, -0.0181]. Both tests agree and the interval excludes zero by more than the 0.0024 run-to-run drift measured on this pool."
